cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SCRAG: Self-Correcting Retrieval-Augmented Generation"
abstract: >-
  A multi-agent retrieval-augmented generation system with hybrid retrieval
  (BM25 and dense vectors fused with Reciprocal Rank Fusion), an LLM guardrail,
  an evaluator-driven self-correction loop, a bounded tool-using agent, and
  Postgres/pgvector-backed sessions and uploads, deployable on free tiers.
type: software
